            <profile id="5e10-29a5-83b1-be20" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon (mace or club). May have light armour (+2 pts) and shield (+2 pts). May ride a horse (free). Bishop: Knights, Men-at-Arms or a Combined Formation of Knights and Men-at-Arms led by a Bishop are Stubborn; Archers or Infantry led by a Bishop may re-roll failed Panic tests. 0-1. (Armies of Chivalry p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="7fca-1c10-d15d-34e2" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
