            <profile id="7661-874f-9a90-861b" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. May wear partial plate armour (free). Mounted Knights may have a lance (+4 pts) and warhorse (free) that can have cloth barding (+4 pts). Mounted Knights are subject to First Charge, +1 rank bonus when mounted. Combined Formation; Knights may be combined with Men-at-Arms. (Armies of Chivalry p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="51e0-77cc-c99d-d6fc" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
