            </profile>
            <profile id="ca21-380c-5489-755d" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Improvised weapons. Open Order. Warband Rule 1. Peasants fear all formed enemy cavalry and infantry except other peasants. Peasant units may not include a Standard or Musician. Not allowed in the Continental army. (Armies of Chivalry p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
